# Pre-change backups, local only. The rule is deliberately general: the
# existing config.local.json.*.bak files were ignored only because they
# matched the config pattern, so a backup of any other file was
# committable. Backups are made routinely before edits, so that was a
# question of when, not whether.
_backups/
*.bak
